":"<p>The fourth-generation Beargrease is longer, lower, and slacker for stable handling when charging in soft conditions. This added control rewards riders on groomed snowy singletrack and long-distance winter races on choppy snow machine trails.<\/p><ul><li>Five sizes (XS–XL)<\/li><li>Slacker head tube angle (65.6 degrees) provides more control when descending steep, slippery terrain<\/li><li>Steeper seat tube angle (77.0 degrees) provides better power transfer from the saddle for traction on loose snow.<\/li><li>Longer rear center (446mm) for added stability in snow<\/li><li>Improved standover for easier dismounts in deep snow<\/li><li>Supports up to 100mm travel suspension fork for more playful riding<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"row_yAmHiK":{"type":"row","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SAL_Carousel-5_Beargrease.jpg","caption":"","heading":"Frame and Fork Updates","text":"<ul><li>Carbon fiber and 6061-T6 aluminum frame options<\/li><li>New Bearpaw carbon and aluminum forks<\/li><li>Clearance for up to 27.5 x 4.5\" or 26 x 4.8\" tires<\/li><li>SRAM UDH compatible<\/li><li>Cargo and accessory mounts for any adventure:<\/li><li>Top tube bag mounts<\/li><li>Direct-mount frame bag mounts under top tube on Carbon<\/li><li>Two to three bottle mounts depending on size<\/li><li>Bottle\/accessory mount under downtube<\/li><li>Two sets of Three-Pack mounts on fork<\/li><li>Rear Rack compatible with use of Salsa Rack-Lock Seatpost Clamp<\/li><li>Downtube fender mount<\/li><\/ul>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["row_QgqG8e","row_ceibMb","row_yAmHiK"],"disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.multirow.presets.name","settings":{"image_height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","heading_size":"h1","text_style":"body","button_style":"secondary","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","image_layout":"alternate-left","section_color_scheme":"","row_color_scheme":"","mobile_content_alignment":"lef